{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5a05595b-4a55-8333-8dfc-a8ed5797316e",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T09:26:14-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kwame Tran",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:23:18-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:23:21-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. I'm calling about a storm drain in front of my place. It's, uh, it's gurgling and there's a sewer smell coming up out of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:23:32-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gurgling and a sewer smell. Okay. Where are you calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:23:37-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "215 Eustis Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:23:40-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "215 Eustis. Got it. Is this since the rain over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:23:45-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the rain Friday and Saturday, three days ago now. It's been [line breaks up] ever since. It's not even raining today and it's still doing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:23:55-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me. It's been what ever since?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:24:00-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gurgling. Ever since. And the water that's sitting around it is running down toward my neighbor's garage. Like, it's actually moving that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:24:09-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Moving toward the neighbor's garage. Is it getting inside, or is it just in the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:24:16-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the driveway so far. Right up to the door though. Is it a city drain or a state one? Because I've got no idea who I'm supposed to be calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:24:28-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City or state. Eustis is a city street, so that one should be ours. If it turns out to be on a state road I'd tell you, but on Eustis it's us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:24:40-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Ours. Good. Because the smell is pretty bad, I'm not gonna lie. [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:24:46-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:24:48-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said it's pretty bad. And the whole street is quiet, so you can hear it. Which is funny, because the people next door have a rooster. A rooster. On Eustis Avenue. I don't know how that's allowed, but that's the other noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:25:04-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A rooster, on the Hill. Well, that's not mine to settle, but I'll stick to the drain. Is the grate blocked with leaves or debris, can you see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:25:15-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some leaves on top. Not a lot. I don't think that's it. It's like it's backed up from underneath."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:25:23-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Backed up from underneath. Okay, that's worth a crew looking at, not just a sweep. I'll put in a work order for 215 Eustis, drain gurgling, odor, water running toward the neighboring garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:25:35-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. When would somebody come, you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:25:38-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "When would they come. They're still catching up from the weekend rain, so I can't give you an hour. Could be a day or two. If water starts getting into the garage or a house, call back right away and say so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:25:54-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call back right away. Okay. Should I leave my number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:25:59-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:26:00-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0193. It's Kwame Tran."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:26:02-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-three, Kwame Tran. Got it. Someone will be in touch or just show up out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:26:09-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks. Hopefully soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T09:26:11-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We'll get it moving. Take care."
    }
  ],
